"""The words about claim hygiene that README.md and its translations add to the generated text.

``NOTE`` is the short safety and security status block that every repository of the family carries
before its "At a glance" section; ``TOOLS`` documents the claim check in the list of tools; ``COMMENT``
is the comment of its command in the build and run block. This file is shared, line by line, with the
other documentation hub.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

